18	/// Registers the `entries` feature into the project's single `get_it`
19	/// instance (`sl`) — mirrors `features/account/account_injection.dart`'s
20	/// pattern. Called from `setupCoreDependencies()` right after
21	/// `Hive.initFlutter()` (Code Map), which must already have run by the
